        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports being more puffed walking to the dining room over the last few months, with no clear acute change in the last few days. Shortness of breath mainly on exertion, for example after approximately 30–40 m along the corridor, and settles within a few minutes of rest."
